// Local iOS build secrets - copy this file to "Secrets.xcconfig" (same
// folder) and fill in real values. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored and is
// included optionally by Debug.xcconfig/Release.xcconfig, so the build still
// succeeds without it - but Maps will not initialize until it's provided
// (see AppDelegate.swift's clear runtime warning).
//
// Get a Google Maps iOS API key from Google Cloud Console
// (APIs & Services > Credentials) and restrict it to the app's iOS bundle ID.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY = YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY
